  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「ガンダムセンチネル」に登場する主役機「S ガンダム」のプラモデル。Gアタッカー、Gボマー、Gコアに分離・変形が可能です。Gアタッカーは腕部、スタビライザーの収納ギミックを実現し、設定通りの変形を楽しめます。3箇所のコクピットも再現し、パイロットも3体付属します。",
      "en": "A plastic model of the main machine \"S Gundam \" that appears in \" Gundam Sentinel\". Can be separated and transformed into G Attacker, G Bomber, and G Core. G Attacker has a storage gimmick for the arms and stabilizer, allowing you to enjoy deformation as per the settings. Three cockpits are also reproduced, and three pilots are also included."
    }
